"......"

//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/ma04/0101030a03'>
//「こうして、村は平和を取り戻しました。
//　領主は生き神様と崇められ、死後は神社に
//祀られて本当の神様になったそうです」
"And so, peace returned to the village. The lord was hailed as a living god, and after his death, they built a shrine and he became a real one."

pt:
//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/ma04/0101030a03'>
